---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Organizational Charter & Governance">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFB800]">Governance &amp; Principles</span>
    <h1 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-2">The TF Unions Charter</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
      This charter codifies how TF Unions operates, selects projects, safeguards student data, and maintains 100% financial transparency.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <article class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-7">
        <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-xl text-white">Article I â€” Non-Profit Mandate &amp; Zero-Cost Access</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          TF Unions is an independent non-profit educational initiative. Our primary metric is student impact, never profit. Core student-facing access to TF News, TF Guide, and TF Connect is and will remain free of charge.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-7">
        <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-xl text-white">Article II â€” Project Selection Criteria</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Before launching any seasonal tool or platform, the Founders and Core Team evaluate:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Real Student Pain Point:</strong> Does it solve a verified, recurring barrier for Egyptian students?</li>
          <li><strong>Zero-Overhead Sustainability:</strong> Can it run reliably on our consolidated open-source infrastructure without recurring bloat?</li>
          <li><strong>Community Upvotes:</strong> Proposals submitted on <a href="/ideas" class="text-[#FFB800] underline">/ideas</a> with strong student demand are prioritized each season.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-7">
        <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-xl text-white">Article III â€” Verified Merit &amp; Credential Integrity</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Every volunteer certificate issued by TF Unions is backed by logged contribution hours in our internal HR pipeline and assigned a permanent cryptographic serial code (`TFU-YYYY-XXXXXX`) verifiable at <a href="https://verify.tfunions.com" class="text-[#FFB800] underline">verify.tfunions.com</a>.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-7">
        <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-xl text-white">Article IV â€” 100% Open-Book Financial Ledger</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Every pound or dollar contributed by community donors, sponsors, or the co-founders is recorded alongside every server and domain invoice on <a href="/transparency" class="text-[#FFB800] underline">tfunions.com/transparency</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

